146
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,460
He must be getting to you.

147
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,640
You're imagining things.

148
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:50,340
Jerk.

149
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:56,180
Nice bike.

150
00:06:56,380 --> 00:06:57,200
Way to go, Nymph.

151
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:58,920
Nice bike, my ass.

152
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,700
Why did you put so much power behind it?

153
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,980
You trying to kill me or something?

154
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:04,200
It's your own stupid fault for zoning out.

155
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:04,900
Hmm.

156
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:06,280
I'm not responsible.

157
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,900
Master, are you all right?

158
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,980
What is her problem?

159
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,840
Okay, beach volleyball is bullshit.

160
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,600
Well, then what do you say we take a boat out on the water?

161
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:18,360
Yeah, sure.

162
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,180
That might be fun.

163
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:19,880
Huh.

164
00:07:20,340 --> 00:07:24,280
It's crunch time, ladies and gents.

165
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:25,820
We're coming down to the water.

166
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,320
Sugata!

167
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:28,700
Check this out, folks.

168
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,620
We've got our...

169
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:30,840
Come on, Sugata.

170
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:33,220
You still have a long way to go.

171
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,400
Oh, that's not good.

172
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:43,380
I think we should just let him do his thing.

173
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:43,700
Yeah.

174
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:47,200
I'm going to go find the boat rental place and grab us one, okay?

175
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:47,760
Yeah.

176
00:07:47,760 --> 00:08:05,880
Hey, nymph.

177
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,600
Hot dog?

178
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:12,660
And now you say thank you.

179
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:14,000
Go ahead, give it a try.

180
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,940
Come on, it won't take too much effort.

181
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:18,040
You're not the boss of me, little bug.

182
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,240
Jeez, I'm sorry.

183
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:19,840
This is great.

184
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:28,460
You're kind of cute when you actually smile, you know that?

185
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,700
Don't sit next to me.

186
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:31,620
Hey, chill out.

187
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:39,020
Hey, I've been meaning to ask you, why did you come here anyway?

188
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:39,840
Why?

189
00:08:40,380 --> 00:08:41,880
No real reason, I guess.

190
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:45,300
I just wanted to find out for myself what the lower world was like.

191
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:48,600
Ah, or maybe it was something like you were worried about how Icarus was doing and you

192
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,680
came here to check up on her.

193
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:51,380
You two are friends, right?

194
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:53,760
Yeah, something like that, I suppose.

195
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:56,620
Because I sure didn't come all the way down here to make friends with you.

196
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:57,420
Oh, I see.

197
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:57,960
Thanks.

198
00:08:58,920 --> 00:08:59,600
Oh, yeah.

199
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:01,380
Where did Icarus go anyway?

200
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:05,260
She's out there.

201
00:09:05,260 --> 00:09:24,540
See, I told you so.

202
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:27,100
What is that lunatic doing at the bottom of the ocean?

203
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:42,100
Do you require assistance, Master?

204
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:44,500
You don't need to worry.

205
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:47,600
Diving down to that depth is a cinch for an alpha like her.

206
00:09:47,780 --> 00:09:49,440
It's all part of their design capabilities.

207
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,200
At least try to float around like a normal person.

208
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:54,400
I mean, what if someone saw you down there?

209
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:59,380
But my wings absorb water, so no matter what, I end up sinking to the bottom.

210
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:01,400
I can't do anything about it.

211
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:02,580
You're so dumb sometimes.

212
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:06,220
Have you ever thought about looking at me as an example and just not getting water on your wings?

213
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,920
Well, they're already wet now.

214
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,920
Oh, crap.

215
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:12,280
No way I can leave Icarus to her own devices.

216
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:14,140
Guess I'll teach her to swim.

217
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,240
Tomoki, I rented the boat.

218
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,260
Check it out.

219
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,760
Hey, Tomoki.

220
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:21,080
No, you're doing it wrong.

221
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:23,060
Your legs go straight out for the flutter kick.

222
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:24,100
I'll keep pulling.

223
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:24,860
You keep kicking.

224
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,140
I'll try, Master.

225
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,200
Is this right?

226
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:28,760
Sorry, still wrong.

227
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:29,680
Kick harder.

228
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:32,400
Tomo, what about us?

229
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:46,900
He can be such a jerk.

230
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:49,680
After I went through the trouble of renting this stupid boat.

231
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:50,980
I don't care anymore.

232
00:10:50,980 --> 00:11:00,680
But if I could swim, this would suck a little less.

233
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:03,980
Hold up.

234
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:04,580
You're serious?

235
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,880
You never learned how to swim?

236
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:06,540
No.

237
00:11:07,540 --> 00:11:09,240
Here, then I'll pull you through the water.

238
00:11:09,620 --> 00:11:10,440
It'll be fun.

239
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:12,080
Come on, give it a shot.

240
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:19,040
Your legs go straight out for the flutter kick.

241
00:11:19,940 --> 00:11:21,260
Tomoki, I'm scared.

242
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:24,000
You're fine.

243
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:26,240
I got you, and I won't let you go, okay?

244
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:38,780
I wonder if he's forgotten about that time.

245
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:41,320
Oh, no.

246
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:42,380
What happened?

247
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:44,220
When did I drift out this far?

248
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:47,040
And great, I let the ore go.

249
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,680
I've been carried away.

250
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:50,880
I...

251
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:53,080
I gotta get back.

252
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,120
Cool.

253
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,140
Let's take another.

254
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,400
It got kind of cloudy all of a sudden.

255
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,660
Hey, has anybody seen Suhara?

256
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:08,340
Now that you mention it,

257
00:12:08,380 --> 00:12:10,720
I saw her hop into a boat by herself not long ago.

258
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:12,080
Maybe she's paddling around.

259
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:12,520
Yeah.

260
00:12:14,260 --> 00:12:15,020
That's right.

261
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:16,980
I forgot, I told her I'd go boating with her.

262
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,060
Hang on.

263
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,260
Is that her?

264
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,420
Suhara, wait!

265
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:36,560
Suhara!

266
00:12:45,020 --> 00:12:52,400
Oh, no!

267
00:12:59,480 --> 00:12:59,960
Amazing.

268
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:08,680
They're flying.

269
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:09,620
In your lane.

270
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,160
Can't do anything on your own.

271
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:12,480
Suhara!

272
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,060
Suhara!

273
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:13,640
Suhara!

274
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,100
Suhara!

275
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:14,600
Suhara!

276
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:17,680
I can't get to the surface.

