Tomaki...

280
00:13:36,060 --> 00:13:38,360
And Nymph, too?

281
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:43,360
Thank you both.

282
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:50,300
No, I owe you an apology, Suhara.

283
