I thought if Icarus caused a scene,

284
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:54,960
it'd end up biting me in the ass like it always does.

285
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:58,400
I guess I just focused on that and forgot all about you.

286
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,020
I really am very sorry.

287
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:09,560
No more going out on the water by yourself, understand?

288
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:14,360
It's dangerous for anybody, let alone someone who never learned to swim.

289
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:19,020
I can't believe it.

290
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:20,640
He actually remembered.

291
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:23,440
Right.

292
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,600
